# This repository vendors a device tree byte-for-byte, so *no* line-ending
# conversion is allowed anywhere. Each file is stored exactly as it exists on
# the build host: the upstream device tree carries CRLF in several XML/conf
# files, while the documentation and shell scripts here are LF.
* -text

# Mark the binaries explicitly so diffs stay readable.
*.bin binary
*.dat binary
*.apk binary
*.jar binary
*.so binary
*.img binary
*.gz binary
